 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "A book for «وما أنزل إلينا». 60 under a night sky with no motif: no apes, pigs or idols drawn. STAGING v4: 59: a town by day; the People of the Book (a group of three) face the believers; nobody speaks the Prophet's words and nobody faces an empty side. They shake their heads on 59:5 (their resentment); the believers hold the book on 59:12 with the book plate (belief in what was revealed); on 59:18-20 the camera stays wide so the whole group is not labelled by the word for most of them. 60 stays ambient: the curse, the wrath and those turned into apes and pigs (never drawn)."
